  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CO-IRB Events under SBA in Cambodia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under Cambodia&#x2019;s i-SME project and Sustainable Business Alliance (SBA), Oxfam Cambodia regularly organizes events to promote inclusive and responsible business. From now until the end of the year, they have planned two major SBA events:

1. IRB x WasteSummit 2025(24&#x2013;25 October, Siem Reap, Cambodia)
&#x2022; A two-day event featuring policy discussions, business cases on IRB, business matching, IB accreditation, networking, and marketplace opportunities.
&#x2022; Aim is to bring in enterprises and speakers from outside Cambodia to enable cross-country learning, with an expected participation of 250&#x2013;300.
&#x2022; While we have already combined resources with partners such as Konrad Adenauer Stiftung (KAS) and Oxfam International, we still require additional budget to reach the scale and quality we envision.

2. SBA Day &#x2013; Annual Gathering (December 2025, Cambodia)
&#x2022; A convening of SMEs, development partners, ecosystem actors, and entrepreneur support organizations.
&#x2022; The focus will be on reflecting on SBA&#x2019;s year-roundactivities, strengthening the IRB ecosystem, and planning forward-looking actions for the coming year.

Both events strongly align with the IRB agenda, and we believe they wouldfit well with the purpose of the additional budget you mentioned. Therefore, we would like to kindly request the allocation of around &#x20ac;8,000 or the available amount for SBA&#x2019;s IRB-focused activities.</narrative>
  </description>
